  {
   "item_id": 420051,
   "item_text": "Click for solution",
   "item_forum_id": 0,
   "item_type": "post_hidden",
   "in_feed": null,
   "is_watched": null,
   "item_score": "992",
   "id": "29163",
   "item_level": "992",
   "post_data": {
    "post_id": 420051,
    "post_type": "forum",
    "topic_id": 17330,
    "poster_id": 10277,
    "post_rendered": "Yay! My first (first) IMOSL solution!<br>\n<br>\nFirst we let <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/3/aa372b2e4655d5a87afc715d1af4a101793abf6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(0) = \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" >.</span><br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/b/05b41881c7f252ff9686648db4ee35ca0be8af6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x)+y) = 2x + f(f(y)-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"249\" height=\"18\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nPlugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ea5b6f6de584d56d19a89cc4923a9d9a5cfa41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=0$\"  width=\"43\" height=\"12\" > into (1):<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/728342eb3ae5b1dc539e5fd23316f9394474ba28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(y+\\alpha) = f(f(y))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nPlugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/2/8523e0e934a40c6fa5f9440eb15f4c9b4f359b03.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=f(y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" > into (1):<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/b/88bfce0c984b83ba562803d5fb5d1589459483ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(f(y))+y) = 2f(y) + f(f(y)-f(y)) \\Rightarrow f(2y+\\alpha) = 2f(y) + \\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"530\" height=\"18\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88ea3916e8089c7edbccc3ff91e58e01a6e2682.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nNow plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/d/8fd70a69be60a34b612ec6626c280d81502c14b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" > into (3):<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/a/18a20a92e7f2f687444fbbc74df49c34530b848d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(-\\alpha) = 2f(-\\alpha) + \\alpha \\Rightarrow f(-\\alpha) = -\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"297\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nPlugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/d/8fd70a69be60a34b612ec6626c280d81502c14b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"11\" > into (2):<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/b/deb807ad8bb4b960a2832254154023eb11bc6c55.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha = f(f(-\\alpha)) \\Rightarrow \\alpha = -\\alpha \\Rightarrow \\alpha = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"274\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nSo (2) can be rewritten as: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/7/577d36f19d8078a378cba936d43eb40151b1e13d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x)) = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" > <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/4/104992efa4deaa9a2dfeeec9b331ad0bf628f80a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nPlugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec89f09c84538ec43930ca5d8e5e0957e2000822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" > into (1):<br>\n<br>\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/45514be071c2da3ae6e2802ca378cfb76a6e12f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x)) = 2x + f(-x) \\Rightarrow f(-x) = -x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"302\" height=\"18\" ><br>\n<br>\nPlugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/0/9a039dd7737265f48ce21ed7c63fbeb9b78232de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-x$\"  width=\"58\" height=\"8\" > for the last equation gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/7/4874544e2638f3712dbb70e5ccf37558a5fc0acb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"18\" > for all <span style=\"white-space:nowrap;\"><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\"  width=\"10\" height=\"8\" >.</span><br>\n<br>\nIt is easy to see that this function indeed satisfies the initial conditions given in the problem.",
    "post_canonical": "Yay! My first (first) IMOSL solution!\r\n\r\nFirst we let $f(0) = \\alpha$.\r\n\r\n$f(f(x)+y) = 2x + f(f(y)-x)$ $(1)$\r\n\r\nPlugging in $x=0$ into (1):\r\n\r\n$f(y+\\alpha) = f(f(y))$ $(2)$\r\n\r\nPlugging in $x=f(y)$ into (1):\r\n\r\n$f(f(f(y))+y) = 2f(y) + f(f(y)-f(y)) \\Rightarrow f(2y+\\alpha) = 2f(y) + \\alpha$ $(3)$\r\n\r\nNow plugging in $y=-\\alpha$ into (3):\r\n\r\n$f(-\\alpha) = 2f(-\\alpha) + \\alpha \\Rightarrow f(-\\alpha) = -\\alpha$\r\n\r\nPlugging in $y=-\\alpha$ into (2):\r\n\r\n$\\alpha = f(f(-\\alpha)) \\Rightarrow \\alpha = -\\alpha \\Rightarrow \\alpha = 0$\r\n\r\nSo (2) can be rewritten as: $f(f(x)) = x$ $(4)$\r\n\r\nPlugging in $y=0$ into (1):\r\n\r\n$f(f(x)) = 2x + f(-x) \\Rightarrow f(-x) = -x$\r\n\r\nPlugging in $x=-x$ for the last equation gives $f(x)=x$ for all $x$.\r\n\r\nIt is easy to see that this function indeed satisfies the initial conditions given in the problem.",
    "username": "Philip_Leszczynski",
    "post_number": 2,
    "post_format": "bbcode",
    "category_name": "High School Olympiads",
    "category_id": 6,
    "poster_avatar": "//avatar.artofproblemsolving.com/avatar_10277.jpg"
   }
  },
